        {
          "id": 3208267723,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Added:\nIf we want to avoid allocating resources to dissabled/\"discarded\"\nprotocols the list needs to be available before register_protocol_xxx is\ncalled.\n\nIf we want to completly disscard a dissecor module we could check in\nregister.c before calling dissector_reg_handoff and reg_handoff. This\nwould be a way to obsolete dissctors with the the possibility to bring them\nback to life as they are still compiled in or exluding a set of\ndissectors.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6792385,
            "username": "AndersBroman",
